ail addresses” belonging to a “small subset of cardholders enrolled in a specific benefit program.”Cybernews says it uncovered datasets connected to 6,000 premium Visa customers, as well as around 2,000 Mastercard customers, if authentic.Update, November 19th: Added information about a Mastercard breach.2 CommentsFollow topics and authors from this story to see more like this in your personalized homepage feed and to receive email updates. :root {
